# Skycrash ("Destroy target artifact", cycling {R}): on turn 1 Bot1 has only an Island and Mox Jet, no red source, so cycling {R} is not
# offered. On turn 3 the first Skycrash refuses Bot2's Llanowar Elves (a creature, not an artifact) and destroys Bot2's Mox Sapphire; the
# second destroys Bot1's own Mox Jet (a tapped one is still a target). On turn 5 the third is cycled for exactly {R} (the Mountain; the
# pool empty after): it is discarded and a card drawn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Skycrash
Skycrash
Skycrash
Mountain
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Mox Sapphire
Island x20

